{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2024-06/1065068/block/singleImage/3274462/df/WhatsApp%20Image%202024-06-19%20at%2010.52.08%20AM%20(2).jpeg?updatedAt=1795341141\"/><figcaption>西九龍中心一名婦人在扶手電梯跌倒。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>深水埗發生扶手電梯意外。今日(22日)下午1時許，警方接報，指西九龍中心一名60多歲女子乘搭扶手電梯時跌倒，懷疑陷入昏迷。</p><p>救援人員接報到場，事主回復清醒，由救護車送往瑪嘉烈醫院治理。案件列作有人意外受傷處理，警方正調查事件。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T10:43:44.640440+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T09:52:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T15:37:17.492916+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T10:37:12.951869+00:00","content_hash":"4cd33cef36c1ee610c9512c4638a98e253afe8e43e547d89dc3e0ff38dd5c48a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T10:43:44.640440+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}